 "nodes": [
  {
   "parameters": {
    "content": "## SignWell contract-events workflow\n\n1. Import this workflow into n8n.\n2. Bind **Airtable PAT Header** (`Authorization: Bearer ...`).\n3. Bind **SignWell API Header** (`X-Api-Key: ...`).\n4. Bind **Close API Header** as Header Auth: `Authorization` = `Bearer REDACTED`.\n5. Activate this workflow and copy the **Production URL** from **SignWell Events**.\n6. Register that URL once with SignWell using `POST https://www.signwell.com/api/v1/hooks`.\n\n`document_sent` saves the SignWell contract link on the Close lead and moves the latest opportunity to the same Contract Sent status used by the PandaDoc blueprint. `document_completed` stores the signed PDF in Airtable and posts `leadId`, `company`, and `additional` to onboarding. Duplicate completions are stopped by **SignWell Completion Forwarded At**.",
    "height": 440,
    "width": 500
   },
   "id": "90b5ff56-db96-407e-a160-775107443c4c",
   "name": "Setup Notes",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
   "typeVersion": 1,
   "position": [
    4048,
    528
   ]
  },
